# Canonical identity for this repository.
#
# The same person committed under several local identities over the years
# (a bare "r <r@r>", the "omp" tooling identity, and a capitalised form of
# the GitHub handle). Collapse them all onto the single GitHub account so
# `git shortlog`, `git log` and `git blame` show one author.
#
# dependabot is deliberately NOT mapped: rewriting a bot's commits to a
# human would misstate who wrote them and would break the bot's ability to
# keep submitting dependency updates.

